  <ThingDef ParentName="DrugBase">
		<defName>FractalPill</defName>
		<label>fractal enhancement</label>
		<description>This pill is rarely found anywhere except only the best archotech societies. When consumed by any mechanical life, it will cause irreversible enhancement, with ever-increasing effect with every use. Due to it's rarity; it's full power has never been documented in any system. What has been documented however is the terrible effects when ingested by humans, which due to the limitations of language cannot be explained in it's full severity.</description>
